<title>NEW ZEALAND: RUGBY UNION-CANTERBURY BEAT WAIKATO 24-15.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-CANTERBURY BEAT WAIKATO 24-15.</headline>
<dateline>TIMARU, New Zealand 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canterbury Crusaders beat the Waikato Chiefs 24-15 (halftime 6-10) in their Super 12 rugby union match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Canterbury - Tries: D. Gibson, K Nepia tries. Penalties: A Mehrtens (3). Conversions: A. Mehrtens. Dropped goal: A. Mehrtens.</p>
<p>Waikato - Tries: R Duggan, P Mitchell. Penalty: M. Cooper. Conversion: M. Cooper.</p>
